OL,3,ASurge in AI-assisted complaints putting
OL,4,Aextra strain on councils and schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany people say AI makes complaining
OL,7,Fmore accessible and effective, with one
OL,8,Fperson telling the BBC it has "made a
OL,9,Freal practical difference in how I've
OL,10,Fbeen able to represent myself".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
